window.products.push({"id":677012,"name":"Moongiantgo Corn Grinder Cast Iron Hand Crank Grain Mill with Large Hopper Table Clamp for Manual Grinding Barley Wheat Berries Coffee Chickpeas Seeds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GSE5yP5sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With Large Hopper - For grinding more grain at one time. Suitable for grinding corn, barley, seeds, coffee beans, rice, chili, soybean, chickpeas, wheat berries, pepper, dried beans and used for home brewing so on. Great for crushing corn or other grains in a pretty coarse mix for animals feed. (It cannot be used to make butter or paste, grind wet grains.) Coarseness Adjustable - You can control the coarseness by adjust the screw for how tight the plate is. It may take multiple grindings to get it as fine as you want. 【NOTE】Grinding effect of manual grain grinder can only reach a mixture of fine particles. So it doesn't make flour and only makes Crushed Grain. If you need superfine state, please choose to purchase our Superfine Electric Grain Grinder (Search ASIN: B086C2VTMR) With Table Clamp & Plastic Cover - Our corn grinder comes with a plastic grinding plate cover, which can be used to prevent particles from splashing when grinding. Designed into hand cranking operation, labor-saving, simple and convenient to fix to the desktop. Max clipped tabletop thickness: 40mm / 1.6 inch. Material & Maintenance - This hand grinder is made of Cast Iron with Electroplated Tin Surface, so it cannot be washed with water directly! Or it maybe get rust. Please kindly wipe it with a damp cloth or use a brush for cleaning. Dry parts and then apply oil to surface to avoid rust. The surface of cast iron products may be a little rough. 1-Year Warranty & Free Parts Replacement - If you find any parts are damaged after receiving product, just contact us, and we promise we provide you with free replacement. Also, any questions or needs during use, email us for help. Easy to Assemble & Use - After assembled, fasten the clamp on the edge of the table, put the materials into the hopper, turn the handle, and you can start grinding. Before using the new grinder, it is recommended to grind some grains several times for the first time, remove the metal and paint shavings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GSE5yP5sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moongiantgo","source_asin":"B09LR5HPB9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LR5HPB9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LR5HPB9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
