window.products.push({"id":677089,"name":"Kitchenka Nonstick Silicone Baking Mat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X8y7WBH-L._AC_SL1450_.jpg","description":"Get Kitchenka silicone baking mat that everyone is talking about and share the secret of a non-stick baking experience with your family. Our non-stick 16.5in x 8.5/8in silicone baking mat fits perfectly into the half size sheet pan (18x13). It is manufactured form the highest grade food silicone and reinforced fiberglass mesh which helps spreading heat evenly for consistent baking. Baking Easier, Healthier and Faster Our Mats are FDA, SGS, and LFBG compliant and are used by professional chefs and everyday moms and dads. This is a must have item for your kitchen. Our mat turns instantly any half size pan into a non-stick surface. You will never have to worry about cleaning messy pans, throwing away burnt cookies or using cooking sprays, oils or parchment paper ever again. The bottom doesn't conduct the heat so goods are baked to perfection and slide off the the mat easily. Mat is perfect for baking cookies, pork chops, chicken, meat balls, salmon, roasting veggies & more. Using our mat saves money helps environment by not using parchment paper and creating less waist. FREE BONUS: Receive 2 free ebooks:1.\"Kitchenka delicious book of cookies\" with over 200 cookie recipes that will bring back great memories. From the old-fashioned, most requested to the newest cookies. 2.\"Kitchenka 600 delicious chocolate recipes\".The ultimate chocolate indulgence. It delivers more than 600 of the best recipes. Lifetime Replacement Guarantee: We guarantee you will be 100% satisfied with your mat or we will replace it at any time no questions asked.   Time is now to turn your messy baking into joyful experience you can share with your entire family. Get your mat today and improve your baking instantly by clicking \"Add to Cart\" button in the beginning of the page","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X8y7WBH-L._AC_SL1450_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchenka","source_asin":"B00HY3L9GU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HY3L9GU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HY3L9GU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":677090,"name":"Ellendi Ultima Comfort Memory Foam Runner Rug - 17\" x 47\", Non-Slip Kitchen Mat - Extra-Long Bath Mat for Bathroom, Kitchen and Bedroom Floor (Gray Bl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y3UAypO8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your tired feet don't deserve stepping on cold, hard floors, especially after a long day. Your feet endure a lot of punishment during the day, carrying your whole weight as you go through your tasks. From housework to commuting, and running errands to gym exercising, your feet take a beating. As soon as you get home, they deserve to be kept warm and comfy, not punished further by stepping on cold floor surfaces. How about a little bit more TLC? The Ellendi Memory Foam Runner gives you happy feet with its warm, soft and comfortable feel. This rug feels plush and comfy under the feet, thanks to its memory foam interior and soft microfiber surface which make you feel like you are stepping on a cloud. Place this mat below the kitchen sink for when you do the dishes, or cushion your feet with it as you relax on the sofa. Don’t worry about the rug slipping and sliding because it features PVC backing, which keeps it firmly planted on your floor. And thanks to the absorbent fiber surface, the runner will quickly absorbs water, keeping your floor dry and clean. Having a hard time deciding? Check out more features of the Ellendi Memory Foam Bath Mat right here: ✅ Adds comfort and elegance to your living space ✅ Easily dry your feet after you shower ✅ New designs that are different from all others on the market ✅ May be used for yoga and other floor exercises Step onto the warmth, softness, and comfort of the Ellendi Memory Foam Runner. Add it to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y3UAypO8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ellendi","source_asin":"B07VWD49XK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677090","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VWD49XK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VWD49XK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
