window.products.push({"id":677165,"name":"Spardar Electric Kettle 1.5L Double Wall Temperature Control Cool Touch Hot Water Boiler Stainless Steel Inner Lid and Bottom, 1800W Rapid Heating for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ESqlO+SkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your kitchen has never experienced a chic like the Spardar kettle: No control element interrupts the elegant black surface of the housing. When switched off, the large LED display disappears completely under the black (but translucent) plastic. When switched on, the white LED display shines out of nowhere. Several temperatures and holding levels are possible: Use the mode button to select one of three target temperatures (M1-M3: 40 °, 80 °, 90 °). Or use the keep warm function, e.g. for enjoying tea. The water is heated to the target temperature and then automatically kept warm for 30 minutes. For your health: The inner housing is made of food-safe SUS 304 stainless steel. Selectable target temperatures, warming function, temperature sensor with intermediate measurements for precise heating control, concealed stainless steel heating element, double wall design, overheating and boil-dry protection, Strix controller with 360 ° base. The display goes off automatically after 5 minutes in standby mode. Or can (if in standby) be switched off specifically. The signal tones - e.g. for the mode change - can be switched off specifically (but not for start and stop).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ESqlO+SkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spardar","source_asin":"B08C27S83P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C27S83P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C27S83P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
