window.products.push({"id":677338,"name":"KES Pot Rack for Kitchen Wall Mounted, Pot and Pan Rack with 16 Hooks, 16-Inch Pot Hanger Wall Mounted 2 Pack Black, KUR222S42A-BK-P2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lFwvJK4fL._AC_SL1259_.jpg","description":"Sturdy Construction: These two ultra-strong metal pot and pan racks have a max load of 44lbs each, making them sturdy enough to hold even large copper or iron skillets. The beautiful matte black finish resists daily scratches and tarnishing. Large Storage Space: KES hanging pot racks provide plenty of room to store all of your most frequently used cookware and utensils. The included 16 detachable, movable S-hooks give you the option to hang items as well. Everything you need for cooking will now always be within arm's reach, easy to find, and well-organized. Total dimensions: 16.7\" x 12\" (424mm x 305mm). Perfectly Spaced for Wall Studs: Each shelf has two mounting screw holes that are 16” apart, which is the typical standard spacing for wall studs. Once the rack is mounted directly into your wall studs using our extra long steel screws and sturdy anchors, you won’t need to worry about placing heavy items on the rack up to its max load. Two Installation Options. The support brackets can be installed to support the rack from above or below based on your preference. Versatile: This multipurpose product can be used as an organizer or display shelf in any room of the house or even the garage!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lFwvJK4fL._AC_SL1259_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KES","source_asin":"B0964LVJ7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0964LVJ7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0964LVJ7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":677339,"name":"30” Wooden Storage Chest – Handmade Amish Hope Chest – Storage Trunk w/Anti-Slam Hinges – Solid Wooden Chest w/Handles – Clothing, Keepsake & Blanket ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":549.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vV-49DfPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Hope Woodworking Wood Storage Chest: Store your clothing, blankets, and valuables in this beautiful, handmade chest for bedroom storage. Each blanket storage chest comes fully assembled with anti-slam hinges to prolong the life and integrity of the chest and keep fingers safe. These storage chests and trunks for bedroom are built with cut-out handles to make lifting and transporting them easy. The large chest storage for blankets is built to accentuate virtually any decor style while adding extra storage. --- Features: Superior Amish Craftsmanship - Anti-Slam Hinges - Custom Engraving Available – Tabletop Grade Varnish – 3 Cut-Outs for Opening, Closing, and Moving - Handcrafted in the USA --- Available Sizes: 24” L x 18” D x 17” H - 30” L x 18” D x 17” H - 36” L x 18” D x 17” H - 42\"L x 18\"D x 17\"H--- Wood & Stain Combinations Available: Cherry with Cherry Stain – Rustic Cherry with Fruitwood Stain – Oak Wood with Antique Slate Stain - Oak Wood with Asbury Stain - Oak Wood with Michaels Stain - Oak Wood with Natural Stain - Oak Wood with Onyx Stain - Oak Wood with Provincial Stain - Oak Wood with Cherry Stain - Rustic Hickory Wood with Natural Stain - Walnut Wood with Natural Stain - Hickory Wood with Asbury Stain - Brown Maple Wood with Asbury Stain--- About Us: Hope Woodworking Store is locally owned and family operated with the primary goal of serving you. We want you to experience the genuine satisfaction that comes from owning solid wood, handcrafted, American-made furniture that will be valued, cherished, and handed down from generation to generation. Our fervent hope is for each heirloom-quality piece to be used as a significant part of extending hospitality towards others just as the expectations of benevolence were passed on to us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vV-49DfPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hope Woodworking","source_asin":"B0BFP86KWQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677339","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFP86KWQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFP86KWQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":677340,"name":"sheetsnthings Ivory- Woven Dots 600 Thread-Count Wrinkle Free King-Size Sheet Set- Cotton Blend- 4pc Bed Sheet Set (Deep Pocket)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":190.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Hkj-O8FZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Wrap your self in the softness of the luxurious Cotton Blend sheets 60% Cotton and 40% polyester. One of the softest fabric in the world on your bed to enjoy a perfect sleep. Amazingly soft Wrinkle Free sheets. Machine wash in cold water.Delicate cycle with mild detergent. No Bleach. Tumble Dry on low heat. Remove immediately at end of cycle. Press with warm iron if needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Hkj-O8FZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sheetsnthings","source_asin":"B00NW82AUU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NW82AUU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NW82AUU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
