window.products.push({"id":677397,"name":"Pilita Digital Instant Read Meat Thermometer for Cooking, Fast & Precise Grill Food Thermometer with Backlight, Magnet, Calibration, and Foldable Prob","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810KW2y0a3L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Accurate Reading- Measuring 1.6mm in diameter, the probe head is easy to stick into meats. Keeping it in food for 2-3 sec, you’ll get the accurate temp (±1°F), which gives you accurate temp reference whether to fry beef steaks or deep fry fish/potatoes. Designed for Easy Usage- The 4.6” long probe protects you from splashing oil. It supports Celsius and Fahrenheit display from -58°F to 572°F (-50°C to 300°C), enabling to read both ice cube and broiling steak. The Hold button lets you see the temp easier. Large Screen at Your Reach- Coming with a large backlight screen, it lets you see the temp clearly both in dim kitchen and bright outdoors. The built-in magnet and hanging hole make storing it a snap. The ergonomic handle makes cooking a total enjoyment! IP67 Waterproof with Durability- With IP67 certification, the grill thermometer is super easy to clean. (NOTE: Please wipe it with a soapy cloth or rinse it to clean, and DO NOT soak it or put in a dishwasher.) The probe is made of 304 stainless steel, non-toxic and safe for contacting food. Coated with premium ABS material, the thermometer lasts long and works with great durability. 100% Satisfying Service- Every product sent to you has gone through a series of quality inspection processes, please rest assured of this meat thermometer. If you have any questions before or after purchase, do not hesitate and contact us, we promise you a satisfying solution!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810KW2y0a3L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pilita","source_asin":"B0B5642V3M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5642V3M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5642V3M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
