window.products.push({"id":677425,"name":"8-Day 13 in. Black Forest House Cuckoo Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j2iWorCsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This cuckoo clock features a high quality Regula 8 Day Movement (raise the weights once per week). The cuckoo calls one at the half hour and calls oncer per hour on the hour. For example, a cuckoo will call 5 times at 5 o'clock, 6 times and 6 o'clock, and so on. The clock plays a melody on the hour and half hour following the cuckoo call. New wooden dial with numerals and hands made of wood, full automatic night shut-off, please read special instructions, wooden cuckoo, hand crafted and hand painted dancing couples made out of solid wood, 2.22, beer drinker. Height: 12.6\" Width: 13\" Depth: 8.3\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j2iWorCsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Schneider","source_asin":"B001RUKMSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001RUKMSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001RUKMSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":677426,"name":"Non-Slip Bathtub Mat with Drain Holes and Suction Cups - Feet Massage and Wet Floor Protection - Shower Mat for Bathroom,Shower Stall and Tub - Machin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BCegJauvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⊙ Excellent anti-skid: COMUSTER high-grade bathtub and shower mat are equipped with special suction cups, which help to fix on smooth and clean surfaces This model has two functions of foot massage and foot cleaning. Our bathtub mat is a perfect choice for families, gyms, etc! ⊙The dome design is like a pebble, which provides a massage experience in the shower and also brings the necessary anti-slip.The newly upgraded part is a foot wash brush for cleaning the soles of the feet. ⊙Option: Our massage pads are 27.5 \"x 15.7\" for maximum coverage. A good drainage system consists of 132 drainage holes, allowing water circulation. Use this bath mat on the bathtub or shower floor for a healthy and beautiful life. ⊙ Machine Washable: Our durable bath mats are machine washable and easy to maintain. So you can simply throw the mat into the machine and wash it in cold water on a gentle cycle. Then hang up to dry. We recommend rinsing and air-drying your bath mat regularly to remove greasy and slippery buildup that may develop over time. ⊙ Instructions for use: first spread the bath mat on the slippery floor or in the bathtub, then press the surface of the bath mat to exhaust the air in the suction cup, and the suction cup is firmly attached to the ground. Make sure the bath mat is no longer moving and you can stand on it to use it. After use, remove the pad and rinse. You will need to take the anti-skid mat and hang it for storage or store it against a wall. Drain and air dry for a hygienic next use. ⊙Important: Please measure the size before placing an order! Thank you very much. ★Note: When you receive the package, as it is rolled up and packaged, please fully open the cushion, fix it in place, use hot water (80 ° C/176 ° F) or so to heat it in the rolled up place, and lay it flat on the ground until it is cooled before using it","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BCegJauvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COMUSTER","source_asin":"B0C4H7F6TR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677426","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4H7F6TR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4H7F6TR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
