window.products.push({"id":677432,"name":"10000mAh Clip on Fan Battery Operated [12-40 Working Hours], Rechargeable Table Fan, 6 Inch Mini Personal Fan with Clamp, 3 Speeds Quiet Bedroom Fan, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RySGUkeCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍃[10000 mAh Portable Clip Fan]: GEHEN personal portable fan. This portable fan is able to use the fan's battery to charge up a phone or tablet in a pinch. Rated use time: 12-40 hours; wind speed: 7-11 mile/h(based on wind speed). strong Clamp design is compatible with all scenes, such as office, home, kitchen, stroller, camping, fishing and so on. (Note: Comes with a 3.94 ft charge cable) 🍃[Comes with a Soft Pad in Clip]: The clip holds strongly and does not fall off. The clip can be fixed to a maximum diameter of 3.0 inches.(7.5 cm) What's more, the bottom of the clip has a non-slip grip. Clamp-on for non-restrictive space on tabletop & clip & hang Can be used in a variety of locations, including in the car, at home, in the office. When used with an air conditioner, it can reduce the temperature setting and conserve power. 🍃[360° Angle Adjustable & 3 Speed Modes]: You can manually adjust it to 360° left and right, and it will deliver cool air in any direction. The wind strength can be switched between 3 stages, weak, medium wind, and strong wind. You can freely adjust the airflow according to your preference. By frequently switching between air flow modes, it reduces wasteful power consumption. In weak mode, the operating sound is quieter than the cooler, so you can use it at work or in the library. 🍃[Ultra Quiet & Safety]: Portable and Ultra Quiet, Equipped with a silent mode that is less than 20 dB so you can sleep soundly all night. Made of superior ABS resin, the safety design of the protector cover makes it impossible to insert even small fingers. Avoid accidents and injuries. 🍃[Package Contents]: Portable fan x 1, Multi-lingual instruction manual x 1. If you have any problems with our products, please feel free to contact us. The shop is responsible for exchanging and returning. We care about our customers' shopping experience and thoughts, in order to provide you with satisfactory products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RySGUkeCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GEHEN","source_asin":"B0C3983HD9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677432","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3983HD9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3983HD9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
