window.products.push({"id":677466,"name":"Reusable Silicone Bags, 8 Pack Leakproof Reusable Food Storage Bags, BPA free, Plastic Free Reusable Freezer Bags, Reusable Baggies for Sandwich, Sili","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ice-zqR0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌍 CREATE A BETTER FUTURE FOR THE PLANET AND YOUR FAMILY! natissy reusable silicone bags are a healthier alternative to disposable plastic bags. Made from 100% pure, food-grade silicone, our non-coated, BPA-free silicone bags can be used to store food safely and without worry. Our silicone bags are not only better than plastic bags but also more economical. Silicon baggies will last you for years, so there’s no need to restock them every month. Imagine how much time&money you would save! ✔ARE YOU SICK OF A MESSY FRIDGE AND KITCHEN? Saving space is our top priority. Compared to plastic containers, our reusable food storage bags offer space-efficient nesting functionalities. Their transparency allows you to see the contents inside clearly; due to their wide base, the reusable freezer bags will stand upright and remain open while you fill them up. They can keep your food fresh without releasing any odours. Use the included organic cotton bag to store bread, fruits & vegetables. 💖 THE BEST MEAL ORGANISER FOR A MODERN HOME! Cook a large quantity of your favourite food & freeze it in the silicone freezer bags. When needed, just stick it straight into the microwave, heat it and eat the food directly from the bag. Now you can always have prepared meals for lunch at work or a quick dinner. Our silicone food bags are resistant to temperatures between -40°F & 450°F, making them completely safe to put in a freezer, fridge or sous vide cooker. Meal prep has never been so easy! ⭐ ALWAYS WITH YOU ON THE GO! Take natissy silicone sandwich bags with you and enjoy your favourite snack everywhere! When you travel, go to school or work! It comes with a BONUS wheat straw spoon and fork for you to enjoy pre-made dishes & a FREE silicone rope to fold & securely store your reusable silicone food bag after use. The sealing clips help prevent leaks & provide extra security while on the go. The zippers are easy to open – even for children! The 8 different sizes for every occasion! 💧 EASILY WASHABLE, QUICKLY DRYABLE & ENDLESSLY REUSABLE. natissy reusable silicone food storage bags are reversible: you can turn them inside out, wash them by hand (using the FREE sponge included) or just simply throw them into the dishwasher & let it do the job for you! No need to worry about bacteria & mould anymore! The round corners are extremely easy to clean. natissy reusable silicone bags don’t stain or retain any odour, so don’t worry about them absorbing smell or becoming oily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ice-zqR0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Natissy","source_asin":"B08YRJ3BRL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YRJ3BRL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YRJ3BRL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
