window.products.push({"id":677615,"name":"Bitonix Oil Sprayer Manual Clog-Free Mister Refillable 4oz Plastic Bottle No Breakages, Leaks or Drips Fine Spray Mist for Low Calories Diet and Weigh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a2cmKjCnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"★ QUICK AND REUSABLE – The Bitonix Oil Sprayer lets you quickly fill up and spray with minimal effort, so you can spend less time messing around dripping oil everywhere, and more time eating – yum! ★ ANY OILS AND SPRAYS SUITALBE – Our sprayer works with all types of oils and sprays for your food – olive oil, coconut oil, sunflower oil, vinegar, lemon, grapeseed - you name it. We eliminate the need for multiple gadgets – ours does it all! ★ SUPERIOR QUALITY WITH 1 YEAR WARRANTY – Our products are made with the highest quality materials and detailed manufacturing processes. Unlike everyone else, you only have to buy our product once. To support this, we provide a 1 year warranty with all our products. If our product breaks within 1 year of purchase, simply send it back and we will happily provide a replacement! ★ FIRM PLASTIC CONTAINER – After going through too many glass oil sprayers of our own, we decided to make a high-quality glass mister instead. We’ve all dropped our kitchen gadgets before – the only difference being ours won’t break ★ VERSATILE DESIGN – Instead of offering a clunky oil sprayer, we opted for a small, lightweight design whilst still maintaining durability. We believe this is just one helpful step towards freeing up your kitchen drawer space","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a2cmKjCnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bitonix","source_asin":"B06XZRTDGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XZRTDGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XZRTDGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
