window.products.push({"id":677632,"name":"WARMDERN Duvet Cover Set King Size Cotton Modern Patchwork Duvet Cover 3 Piece Ultra Soft Solid White Bedding Comforter Cover with Zipper Closure & Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gT0P3FSoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SUPER SOFT & SLEEP TIGHT】WARMDERN duvet cover is crafted from 100% nature cotton fabric. Compared with other materials, the cotton duvet cover is more breathable and keeps your body crisp. Skin-friendly and smooth beyond imagination, allowing you to sleep all night while relaxing. When you are covered with a soft duvet cover, it seems to be wrapped by light feathers, providing you with the ultimate comfort. It's cooling in summer and warm in winter, suitable for all seasons 【AESTHETIC DESIGN & All-MATCHING】The modern duvet cover with reversible design will bring you an unusual double experience. The front of the patchwork duvet cover is used simple white and blue match, with chic appearance that creates an elegant atmosphere for your bedroom. The timeless light blue appearance on the back is suitable for modern home style. It looks like an exquisite artwork that couldn't be better as a gift to your friends and family on Christmas or Thanksgiving Day 【INTIMATE DETAIL & CAREFREE LIFE】The bedding duvet cover with a hidden metal zipper closure to make the comforter easier to insert or take out. Features four interior corner ties that attach to corner loops on the comforter to secure both in place and never getting curled up. The pillowcases are envelope opening, which is more convenient for disassembly. Paying attention to every detail will reduce the time required to straightening up the bed, and keep your life away from worries 【EASY CARE】Machine wash in cold water with similar color, gentle cycle, dry at low temperature. Do not bleach. Do not iron. Recommend wash before use. Please read the care label carefully before cleaning. The solid color duvet cover adopts superb reactive dyeing technology, which has high color fastness and is not easy to fade, still keeps bright and beautiful after repeated washing. The white duvet cover which is popular among men and women, young and old is suitable for any rooms 【What Can You Get】You will get 3 piece duvet cover set, including 1 duvet cover (104\" x 90\") and 2 pillowcases (20\" x 36\"). NOT INCLUDE COMFORTER. WARMDERN bedding collection has other styles and colors to choose from. We are committed to providing the best shopping experience to every customer. We support 30 days unconditional refund and replacement service. If you have any issues, please feel free to contact us, we are happy to provide you with solutions within 24 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gT0P3FSoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WARMDERN","source_asin":"B09B3873XK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B3873XK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B3873XK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
