window.products.push({"id":677874,"name":"11x14 Picture Frames Black Solid Wood - Matted to Display Pictures 9x12 or 8x10 or 11x14 Frame without Mat - Wooden Photo Frame 11x14 inch Black with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uZmqXbw5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❥【Say No to Cheaply Made】 Tired of cheap composite wood, low transparency fragile glass or poor workmanship? Choose Tiblue ! 11x14 black picture frame is made of solid pine wood painted with nice-looking paint to make sure amazing durability and beautiful finished look. High definition plexiglass cover will give a clear view of your cherished picture like glass, preserve them perfectly. No worrying about injury due to accidental glass breakage (Peel protective films before use). ❥【Flexible Design Fits 3 Sizes Photo】 Two piece of mats are affiliated to each 11 x 14 matted frame to display 9 x 12 or 8 x 10 photo with mat to meet your needs, which is most cost-effective & great value in the market. Also perfect displaying 11x14 inch photos without mat! (Note:Actual mat opening size are about 8.5”x11.5” and 7.5”x9.5”). Include a classic print of Red Phone Booth and Eiffel Tower, the 11x14 classic photo frame will display tasteful and artistically in rustic vintage style! ❥【A Gift People Will Actually Use】 Finish it with a special photo and this 11x14 farmhouse wooden frame instantly turns into a one-of-a-kind, impressive gift that your recipient will cherish for a lifetime! Our 11 by 14 picture frame for 9\"x12\" and 8\"x10\" is a great choice for living room, bedroom, kitchen, dining room, bathroom ,office wall decoration as well as warm gifts for your friends and family. Suitable for display family photos, landscape pictures, prints, drawings, papers, artworks. ❥【Vertical & Horizontal Wall Mounting or Tabletop Display】 Equipped with 2 study hangers ( for horizontal or vertical) and durable wooden stand, you can display your picture on the tabletop or hang it on the wall easily, either horizontal or vertical way. 11x14 wooden picture frame has sturdy easel back with 6 flexible swivel tabs that make you switch photos in and out effortless and quickly. Placing this 11x14 frames matted opening 9x12 / 8X10, you will feel warm atmosphere added in your home. ❥【Well-Packaged & Worry-Free Warranty】Each 11 x 14 Picture Frame for wall hanging or tabletop has been wrapped very carefully in hard carton to ensure shipping. Tiblue provide fast & professional customer service, please do not hesitate to send us your issues for replacement or refund if you are not completely satisfied. 24 online service is here always! Customer satisfaction is always our priority. Purchase the rustic collage picture frame with confidence, enjoy decorating your house together!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uZmqXbw5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiblue","source_asin":"B092D3F1Q8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677874","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092D3F1Q8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092D3F1Q8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":677875,"name":"Missouri State Montage Wood Fridge Magnet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n82d86XKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Here's a brand new, rare and a hard to find collector's item: Missouri State Montage Fridge Magnet 2\" x 3\".These magnets are made of wood and are safe and non-toxic. They are also water resistant but not waterproof and it's not advisable to keep them in water for prolonged periods of time. These magnets are standard and not 3D (tri-dimensional). Please note : these magnets MAY NOT stick to stainless steel appliances. So please check in advance whether or not the surface you are planning to use is \"magnet friendly\". These are all very rare and would make a wonderful addition to anyone's collection or make a great gift! Items will be shipped by USPS or other major carriers and will be packed securely.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n82d86XKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Souvenir Destiny","source_asin":"B00ZBEXKPW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677875","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZBEXKPW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZBEXKPW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":677876,"name":"Moose Balloons (16 pcs) by Nerdy Words (Red and Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lbBvWTWdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Burly. Rugged. These trendy moose balloons are a perfect addition to your lumberjack / hunting themed party. Going axe throwing for your bachelor party? Or just chopping some wood? What about a Lumberjack and Jill party? These are the balloons for you. Balloons are helium quality and come in assorted colors (Red and Black) with white ink. 16 balloons in each pack. BALLOON SPECIFICATIONS: Material: Helium Quality, 100% Biodegradable Latex Material: Helium Quality, 100% Biodegradable Latex Size: 12 Inch (30 cm) Size: 12 Inch (30 cm) Colors: Red and Black Colors: Red and Black Package: 16 Balloons Package: 16 Balloons Design: White Ink, 1-Side Design: White Ink, 1-Side BALLOON INFLATION: If the balloons are properly inflated (ie. not over- or under-inflated) they will last about 8-14 hours if helium filled and 5-7 days if air filled. Actual flying time will vary depending on temperature and atmospheric conditions. **If left outside in the hot sun or rain, the balloons will last only a few hours.** WARNING! CHOKING HAZARD - Children under 8 years can choke or suffocate on uninflated or broken balloons. Adult supervision required. Keep uninflated balloons away from children. Discard broken balloons at once. MISE EN GARDE! DANGER D'ÉTOUFFEMENT - Les enfants de moins de 8 ans peuvent s'étouffer ou suffoquer avec des ballons non gonflés ou éclatés. La surveillance doit être assurée par un adulte. Tenir les ballons non gonflés à l'écart des enfants. Jeter immédiatement les ballons éclatés.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lbBvWTWdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nerdy Words","source_asin":"B06XTPFSDK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677876","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XTPFSDK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XTPFSDK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
