window.products.push({"id":677939,"name":"Revere Copper Ellipse 7-Piece Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518BM5SY6RL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Revere Copper Ellipse 7-Piece Set. Includes 1-Each 1-1/2-Quart Saucepan, 1-Each 2-Quart Saucepan With Cover, 1-Each 6-Quart Dutch Oven With Cover, 1-Each 9.1/2-Inch Skillet. For style-conscious cooks, the uniquely rounded contours of Revere's Copper Ellipse collection offers distinction and high performance for today's kitchens. The shapely cookware is crafted of polished stainless steel with copper encapsulated bases for fast, even heat distribution. Hollow stainless steel handles together with gleaming flat stainless steel lids and loop handles add a professional look. Copper Ellipse is oven safe to 500° F. Amazon.com Baby boomers and maybe even some Gen-Xers probably remember their mothers using Reveres classic stainless-steel cookware with copper bottoms to prepare all the family meals. The \"it\" cookware of the 50s and 60s, Revere now has plenty of competition with all the new manufacturers and innovations in cookware construction. However, for those looking for the Revere cookware from their youth, the Copper Ellipse line comes close, using the same time-tested materials and offering a sturdy product that is still light enough to handle easily. This 7-piece set includes a 10-inch skillet for sautéing shrimp or stir-frying chicken. A 6-quart stockpot with a lid is ideal for simmering hearty soups or braising beef for stew. Two covered saucepans, in 1-quart and 2-quart sizes, round up the collection and are useful for cooking rice, heating up smaller portions of seafood gumbo, or reducing a dessert syrup. The bodies of these pots and pans are made of high-quality 18/10 stainless steel and the bottoms are all made of encapsulated copper, which is the best metal for heat conductivity. Like the originals, Copper Ellipse pans have a rounded shape, making it easier to get in the corners for more thorough cleaning. The updated stainless-steel handles are rolled for a more comfortable grip and a contemporary look. Lids are constructed of a heavy-weight stainless steel and have modern-looking, easy-to-grip loop handles. All pans are oven-safe up to 500 degrees Fahrenheit. This cookware should be handwashed and the copper bottoms will require polishing in order to maintain their brilliant luster. Copper Ellipse cookware is covered under a limited 25-year warranty. --Cristina Vaamonde Whats in the Box 10-inch skillet, 6-quart stockpot with lid, 2-quart saucepan with lid, 1-quart saucepan with lid.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518BM5SY6RL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Revere","source_asin":"B0001CXRSE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001CXRSE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001CXRSE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
