window.products.push({"id":677959,"name":"Vitamix, Pearl Grey, Series 750 Blender, Professional-Grade, 64 oz. Low-Profile Container & Mini-Tamper, 9.75 inches, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":645.57,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Tcp65TjeL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Vitamix, Pearl Grey, Series 750 Blender, Professional-Grade, 64 oz. Low-Profile ContainerVitamix fuels passions. It’s why we’re the brand most trusted by professional chefs. But you won’t just find us in restaurant kitchens. You’ll also find us in home kitchens around the world. Because Whether you’re interested in the culinary Arts, making healthier choices, or enjoying restaurant-quality smoothies at home—when you’re ready to move on and move up, when you’re ready to invest in your passion, you’re ready for Vitamix. Built to last a bargain blender's not a bargain if it doesn't last. We know purchasing a Vitamix blender is an investment. But Vitamix blenders are built to last, helping you buy dependable, not disposable. Easy to clean just blend warm water and a drop of dish soap at your machine's highest speed, and watch it self-cleaning in 60 seconds or less - no disassembly required. The difference is in the blend since the number-one reason people purchase a blender is to make smoothies, it’s important to Get them right. Whether you prefer an icy blend or a perfectly smooth purée, nutrition-packed with veggies or a light, fruity treat, Vitamix smoothies give you a delicious, even blend in every sip. Power We don’t aim to have the highest horsepower. You don’t need more Horses; you need trained ones. The focused power of our complete blending system causes every component of the Vitamix machine to work together, creating faster, smoother blends packed with flavor. The universal tool make smoothies & juices, hot soups, flours & dough, nut butter, frozen desserts, batters, dressings & sauces, non-dairy milks, and more. Manufactured in Cleveland, Ohio USAVitamix Mini-Tamper, 9.75 inches, BlackThe tamper presses ingredients into the blades of the 32-ounce and 48-ounce, allowing you to process thick and frozen mixtures with ease.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Tcp65TjeL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vitamix","source_asin":"B07VGBRBDD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VGBRBDD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VGBRBDD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":677960,"name":"HomeLife Solutions Stainless 18 oz Steel Stemless Wine and Cocktail Glasses Pack of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515LstUHZ2L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The HomeLife Solutions 18 Oz Stemless Stainless Steel Wine glass is made of durable 18/8 quality Stainless and its satin finish looks beautiful. These great cocktail / wine glasses are great for keeping drinks cooler for longer periods of time. Glass and plastic are simply not as good at insulating. It’s great for serving wine, cocktails, and any other tasty cold drink. Why Stainless Steel and not Glass? The stainless steel construction of this cup makes it lighter than glass, more durable than glass, and it will keep your drink cooler longer. No more worrying about dropping your glass and it shattering everywhere. Food grade #304 or 18/8 stainless steel means, there is 18% chromium and 8% nickel. This is a high quality SS that most high quality utensils or stainless steel reusable water bottles are made of. High quality Stainless Steel Translated to, no nickel leaching, which in turn means safer for consumers like you. Why it’s safer for you With high quality Stainless Steel, cups should not taste metallic either, which is unlike aluminum bottles. Stainless steel cups are safer for use in any area. Unlike glass, Stainless steel cups can be used by pool side, schools, camping, anywhere you travel, gyms, beaches, and any other areas that do not allow fragile glass bottles for safety reasons. Stainless steel has no limitation for usage and will not hurt anyone since it does not leach chemicals (as in plastic) or break (as in glass), and possibly cause bodily harm. Recyclable Stainless steel is 100% recyclable: When recycled, each component can be separated and reused. In fact, stainless steel should never end up as a waste. It can be reused time and time again so the sustainability factor beats any other material for its life cycle length.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515LstUHZ2L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeLife Solutions","source_asin":"B014EM72PU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-677960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014EM72PU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014EM72PU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
